OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe east will be mostly cloudy
OL,6,Fwith some outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Further west will be mostly
OL,8,Fdry with bright and sunny intervals
OL,9,Fdeveloping later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely cloudy at first but
OL,12,Fincreasing clear spells developing,
OL,13,Fallowing areas of frost and fog to
OL,14,Fform. Staying cloudier around the
OL,15,Fcoast which may may still see the odd
OL,16,Fshower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
