OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F176A1794116854
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,6,Fplaces. Otherwise mostly dry with
OL,7,Fvariable cloud and bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Some showers around the coast.
OL,9,FFrost and fog possible again overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,12,FTuesday with variable cloud
OL,13,Finterspersed with sunny spells. Bright
OL,14,Fspells and perhaps a few showers on
OL,15,FWednesday. Colder on Thursday with
OL,16,Fbright spells and some showers.
OL,17,FOvernight frost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
